   "observation": "deployed+listener+index-count+snapshot+unrepresentable; two phases on separate paths: preload create+insert+index over @public keepall AWindow (100 E-rows + (-1,'x'), index count 1, 101-row snapshot), then late s0 unidirectional join delivers one {s0:(-1,x),aw:(-1,x)} pair and late s1 subquery delivers its scalar, undeploy-all boundary, indexshare-hinted phase B deploys the identical subquery as s2 delivering the same scalar; getter-count asserts (101,2,2,2) ride unrepresentable records",
   "epl": "@public create window AWindow#keepall as SupportCountAccessEvent\ninsert into AWindow select * from SupportCountAccessEvent\ncreate index I1 on AWindow(p00)\n@name('s0') select * from SupportBean_S0 as s0 unidirectional, AWindow(p00='x') as aw where aw.id = s0.id\n@name('s1') select (select id from AWindow(p00='x') as aw where aw.id = s0.id) from SupportBean_S0 as s0 unidirectional\n@Hint('enable_window_subquery_indexshare') @public create window AWindow#keepall as SupportCountAccessEvent\ninsert into AWindow select * from SupportCountAccessEvent\ncreate index I1 on AWindow(p00)\n@name('s2') select (select id from AWindow(p00='x') as aw where aw.id = s0.id) from SupportBean_S0 as s0 unidirectional",
